Package: haiexplorer
Title: Explore the Burden of Hospital Infections
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vibhor", "Dabas", email = "dabasvibhor@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data, a ranking function and a Shiny app to help
    infection-prevention managers compare the yearly burden of five
    hospital-acquired infections in Germany and Europe by cases, deaths
    and disability-adjusted life years (DALYs). Data are derived from the
    ECDC point prevalence survey 2011-12 via the BHAI package.
